@page "/"

<PageTitle>HamBus Suite</PageTitle>

<section class="hero-panel">
	<div class="hero-copy">
		<span class="hero-kicker">Amateur radio software</span>
		<h1>HamBus Suite</h1>
		<p class="hero-lead">
			HamBus Suite is the web home for the HamBus family of tools. Today the suite includes
			<strong>HamBusLog</strong>, with room to grow into additional logging, contest, and station-management tools.
		</p>
		<div class="hero-actions">
			<a class="btn btn-primary" href="products">Browse products</a>
			<a class="btn btn-outline-primary" href="/static/hambuslog.html">Open static HamBusLog page</a>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="hero-card">
		<div class="suite-stat">1</div>
		<div class="suite-stat-label">Live product in the suite today</div>
		<hr />
		<p>
			The site already supports interactive Blazor routes and direct static HTML pages side by side,
			giving the suite room for product pages, docs, downloads, and future account features.
		</p>
	</div>
</section>

<section class="content-section">
	<div class="section-heading">
		<h2>What this starter site includes</h2>
		<p>A foundation for both application UX and straightforward marketing or documentation pages.</p>
	</div>

	<div class="feature-grid">
		<article class="feature-card">
			<h3>Blazor Server routes</h3>
			<p>Use interactive components when you need live filtering, forms, dashboards, or authenticated workflows.</p>
		</article>
		<article class="feature-card">
			<h3>Static HTML pages</h3>
			<p>Serve plain pages directly from <code>wwwroot</code> for simple docs, product sheets, release notes, and legal pages.</p>
		</article>
		<article class="feature-card">
			<h3>Suite-first structure</h3>
			<p>The navigation and sample content are already framed around the broader HamBus suite instead of a single sample app.</p>
		</article>
	</div>
</section>

<section class="content-section">
	<div class="section-heading">
		<h2>Current product focus</h2>
		<p>The suite currently centers on the existing desktop logger in this repository.</p>
	</div>

	<div class="product-spotlight">
		<div>
			<span class="status-pill status-live">Available now</span>
			<h3>HamBusLog</h3>
			<p>
				A cross-platform desktop logging application with contest support, DX spotting, WSJT-X integration,
				rig control, ADIF/Cabrillo workflows, and data-backed configuration.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="spotlight-actions">
			<a class="btn btn-outline-secondary" href="products">Product details</a>
			<a class="btn btn-outline-secondary" href="/static/hambuslog.html">Static overview</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
